{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50431","headline":"四三 · 王梵志","name":"四三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亲客号不疎，（「号不疏」，伯三六五九、斯四六六九卷作「无疏伴」。\n）建唤则须唤。\n（「建唤则须唤」，伯三七一六卷作「来即閗须唤」，伯三五五八、伯三六五六、斯三三九三作「唤即尽须唤」。\n）食食甯且休，只可待他散。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}